#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Author-owned V9 group B. Numerical exercises are synthetic, not process recipes."""
import json, copy
from pathlib import Path
ROOT=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[2]
CAT={x['id']:x for x in json.loads((ROOT/'public/academy/data/catalog.json').read_text())}
DATA={}
def course(n,stages,focus,boundary,example,wrong,refs,related,units):
    rows=[]
    for line in units.strip().splitlines():
        fields=line.split('|'); assert len(fields)==3,(n,line)
        fields=[x.split('~',1) for x in fields];assert all(len(x)==2 for x in fields)
        rows.append(fields)
    assert len(rows)==12,(n,len(rows))
    DATA[f'a{n}']=dict(stages=stages,focus=focus,boundary=boundary,example=example,wrong=wrong,refs=refs,related=related,units=rows)

course(136,'回流與埠定義~Returns and ports|場解與降階~Fields and reduction|驗證與誤差~Validation and error|耦合與交付~Coupling and delivery',
 '回流路徑、頻率相依 RLGC 與模型因果性~Return paths, frequency-dependent RLGC and model causality',
 '準靜態 RLGC 模型不能跨越明顯輻射或共振區間；需以電氣長度、全波結果與量測共同界定適用頻帶。~Quasi-static RLGC does not automatically cover radiative or resonant regimes; bound its band using electrical length, full-wave results and measurement.',
 '假設回路 L=0.8 nH、電流變化率 0.5 A/ns，L·di/dt=0.4 V；L 的 10% 不確定度單獨造成 0.04 V 不確定度。這是集中回路瞬態估算，未含傳輸線反射。~Assume loop L=0.8 nH and current slew 0.5 A/ns: L·di/dt=0.4 V. A 10% uncertainty in L alone contributes 0.04 V uncertainty. This lumped transient estimate excludes line reflections.',
 '只有信號線就能定義唯一回路電感~A signal trace alone defines a unique loop inductance|網格越細就不必檢查埠定義~A fine mesh removes the need to check ports',
 ['q3d','ti-pdn'], [('a133','回流與阻抗預算可轉為供電網路模型~Return and impedance budgets transfer to PDN models','寄生萃取提供元件；供電完整性要加上負載頻譜與穩壓器~Extraction supplies components; PI adds load spectra and regulators'),('a134','寬頻互連資料可供眼圖與串音分析~Broadband interconnect data supports eye and crosstalk analysis','SI 更重視終端、時序與差分不平衡~SI emphasizes terminations, timing and differential imbalance')],r'''
畫出閉合電流回路~Draw closed current loops|自感、互感與回流一起決定回路電感，參考導體不是可省略的裝飾。~Self and mutual inductance combine with the return path; reference conductors cannot be omitted.|保持信號幾何固定，只移動回流平面，比較回路電感。~Keep signal geometry fixed and move only the return plane; compare loop inductance.
定義埠與參考面~Define ports and reference planes|萃取端點應對應電路模型的電壓電流定義，錯誤埠可製造假性耦合。~Extraction terminals must match circuit voltage and current definitions; incorrect ports create artificial coupling.|列出各埠的正負導體與電流方向，檢查 Kirchhoff 守恆。~List positive/negative conductors and currents for each port; check Kirchhoff conservation.
建立材料頻散表~Tabulate material dispersion|導電率與介電損耗影響頻率響應，單一 DC 數值不能替代完整材料模型。~Conductivity and dielectric loss affect frequency response; one DC value cannot replace a broadband material model.|比較固定介電常數與具頻散模型，標出差異最大的頻段。~Compare constant-permittivity and dispersive models; mark the band of greatest difference.
解析導體表皮效應~Resolve conductor skin effect|集膚效應改變有效導電截面，AC 電阻與電流擁擠須由頻率及幾何共同判讀。~Skin effect changes effective conducting area; interpret AC resistance and crowding through both frequency and geometry.|用低高兩頻的表面電流分布交叉檢查電阻趨勢。~Cross-check resistance trends against surface-current maps at low and high frequencies.
分開部分與回路電感~Separate partial and loop inductance|部分電感矩陣需經回路組合，單一矩陣對角元素不等於實際供電回路電感。~Partial-inductance matrices require loop combination; one diagonal entry is not the actual supply-loop inductance.|把正反導體互感列入回路計算，核對能量非負。~Include mutual terms for forward and return conductors and verify nonnegative energy.
建立電容與導納矩陣~Build capacitance and admittance matrices|導體間電容與對地電容共同決定電荷守恆，浮接金屬會改變電場邊界。~Mutual and ground capacitances jointly determine charge conservation; floating metal changes field boundaries.|比較浮接屏蔽與接地屏蔽，檢查矩陣符號與總電荷。~Compare floating and grounded shields; check matrix signs and total charge.
做網格收斂試驗~Test mesh convergence|局部尖角會提高場強，但極端局部值未必是可量測的封裝平均量。~Corners concentrate fields, but extreme local values need not represent measurable package averages.|逐次細化關鍵縫隙，追蹤阻抗與總儲能而非只看彩圖。~Refine critical gaps and track impedance and stored energy rather than color maps alone.
建立寬頻擬合模型~Fit a broadband model|降階擬合需保留被動性與因果性，否則時間域可能出現非物理增益。~Reduced models must preserve passivity and causality or time responses may show unphysical gain.|用階躍響應與被動性檢查辨別插值振盪。~Use step response and passivity checks to identify interpolation oscillations.
安排去嵌入驗證~Plan de-embedding validation|量測治具、連接器與探針都會加入寄生；未去嵌入的比較可能錯怪晶片。~Fixtures, connectors and probes add parasitics; uncorrected comparisons can falsely blame the die.|建立 through 或已知校正件，分開治具誤差與模型誤差。~Use a through or known standard to separate fixture and model error.
計算切換過衝~Calculate switching overshoot|電壓過衝與 L·di/dt 相連，但多路徑耦合與傳輸延遲會破壞單電感近似。~Overshoot relates to L·di/dt, but coupled paths and propagation delay limit a single-inductor approximation.|重算課程算例，並將 L 上下調 10% 畫出電壓範圍。~Recalculate the worked example and vary L by ±10% to plot a voltage range.
耦合電熱模型~Couple electrical and thermal models|焦耳熱提高導體溫度，電阻率溫度相依會回饋損耗，不能只做單向場圖。~Joule heating raises conductor temperature; temperature-dependent resistivity feeds back into loss.|比較冷態與熱態電阻，說明迭代收斂判準。~Compare cold and hot resistance and define an iterative convergence criterion.
封存可重現模型~Archive a reproducible model|可重現交付需附幾何版本、材料來源、頻帶、埠序與誤差界線。~Reproducibility requires geometry version, material sources, band, port order and uncertainty bounds.|讓另一位學徒只依交付資料重建一個阻抗頻點。~Have another learner reconstruct one impedance point from the handoff alone.
''')

course(137,'電荷與阻抗需求~Charge and impedance needs|元件與佈局~Components and layout|頻域與時域~Frequency and time|老化與驗收~Aging and acceptance',
 '去耦電容、ESR/ESL 與反共振~Decoupling capacitance, ESR/ESL and antiresonance',
 'ΔV=IΔt/C 是初始電荷估算；有效電容、路徑電感與穩壓器響應決定真實瞬態，不能以標稱容量直接保證電源品質。~ΔV=IΔt/C is an initial charge estimate; effective capacitance, loop inductance and regulator response govern actual transients.',
 '假設 1 A 負載維持 2 ns 且只容許 20 mV 電容放電，C≥100 nF；若有效容量僅標稱的 60%，標稱值至少 167 nF。未含 ESL 過衝與控制迴路。~Assume a 1 A load for 2 ns and 20 mV allowed capacitive droop: C≥100 nF. At 60% effective capacitance, nominal capacitance must be at least 167 nF. ESL overshoot and regulator action are excluded.',
 '並聯越多種容量必定降低所有頻率阻抗~Paralleling more values always lowers impedance at every frequency|標稱容量就是工作偏壓下容量~Nominal capacitance equals capacitance under operating bias',
 ['ti-pdn','ti-decap'], [('a133','以目標阻抗連結負載階躍與供電網路~Target impedance links load steps to the PDN','去耦是局部儲能；PI 包含整個電源配送路徑~Decoupling is local storage; PI covers the entire power path'),('a136','從萃取資料取得實際安裝 ESL~Extracted data supplies mounted ESL','元件規格的 ESL 不包含所有封裝回流~Component ESL does not include every package return')],r'''
界定負載電荷~Define load charge|電流脈衝面積才是電荷需求，峰值相同的兩個脈衝可能需要不同儲能。~Pulse area determines charge; equal peak currents can require different stored charge.|畫兩個峰值相同而寬度不同的負載脈衝，積分比較。~Draw equal-peak pulses of different duration and compare their integrals.
建立目標阻抗~Set target impedance|允許電壓擾動除以負載變化可作初步目標阻抗，仍需指定頻帶。~Allowed voltage disturbance divided by load change gives an initial impedance target with a specified frequency band.|將電壓容差分給 DC 壓降、漣波與瞬態，避免重複使用預算。~Allocate tolerance to DC drop, ripple and transients without double-counting.
盤點電荷供應層級~Map charge-supply hierarchy|晶片、封裝與板級電容跨不同時間尺度供電，互連電感阻止所有電容瞬間共同作用。~Die, package and board capacitors supply different timescales; interconnect inductance prevents instantaneous joint action.|在時間軸標出各層開始支援的概念順序。~Place each storage level on a conceptual response timeline.
換算有效容量~Convert to effective capacitance|偏壓、溫度與容差會使陶瓷電容有效值偏離標稱，不能只按封裝尺寸選料。~Bias, temperature and tolerance shift ceramic capacitance from nominal; case size alone is insufficient.|讀供應商偏壓曲線，以最低有效容量重算放電量。~Use a vendor bias curve and recalculate droop with minimum effective capacitance.
拆解 ESR 與 ESL~Separate ESR and ESL|ESR 決定阻尼與瞬態階躍，ESL 則決定高頻感性斜率。~ESR sets damping and an instantaneous voltage step; ESL sets the high-frequency inductive slope.|在阻抗曲線標出容性、自諧振與感性區。~Label capacitive, self-resonant and inductive regions on an impedance plot.
縮短安裝回路~Shorten the mounted loop|電源與接地過孔的位置共同決定安裝電感，幾何距離短不保證回路面積小。~Power and ground vias jointly determine mounting inductance; short distance does not guarantee small loop area.|比較並排與遠離回流過孔，畫出完整電流環。~Compare nearby and remote return vias and draw complete current loops.
辨識反共振~Identify antiresonance|不同電容支路的感性與容性可形成高阻抗峰，總容量大仍可能失敗。~Inductive and capacitive branches can produce an impedance peak despite large total capacitance.|對兩支路並聯模型掃頻，記錄峰頻與阻尼變化。~Sweep a two-branch parallel model and record peak frequency and damping.
分離負載與量測探針~Separate load and probe effects|示波器探針接地引線可加入響鈴，量測位置也改變觀察到的供電雜訊。~Probe ground leads add ringing, and measurement location changes observed supply noise.|比較短接地與長接地探測假想結果，追溯差異。~Compare hypothetical short- and long-ground probing results and trace the difference.
驗算電荷缺口~Check charge deficit|有限電容不能在整個負載事件維持理想電壓，補電時間與初始電壓都必須記錄。~Finite capacitance cannot hold ideal voltage throughout a load event; recharge time and initial voltage matter.|重算 100 nF 算例，將脈寬加倍並檢查 ΔV 的變化。~Recalculate the 100 nF example, double pulse duration and check the change in ΔV.
測試失效支路~Test a failed branch|一顆電容開路可能移動反共振，短路則屬不同的電源保護問題。~One open capacitor can move antiresonance; a shorted capacitor is a different protection problem.|分別移除一條電容支路與加入漏電支路，比較可辨識症狀。~Remove a capacitor branch and separately add leakage; compare distinguishable symptoms.
估計製造散布~Estimate manufacturing spread|電容與電感公差可能互相抵消或疊加，單一典型曲線無法代表最壞情況。~Capacitance and inductance tolerances may offset or compound; one typical curve does not bound worst cases.|以高低 C、L 組成四角測試，記錄最大阻抗。~Test the four high/low C and L corners and record maximum impedance.
交付去耦證據~Deliver decoupling evidence|放行資料應包含目標、量測参考面、有效容量、阻抗峰與負載階躍。~Acceptance evidence needs targets, measurement planes, effective capacitance, impedance peaks and load steps.|用相同負載與頻帶比較兩種佈局，不用電容顆數替代結果。~Compare two layouts under identical load and band, rather than by capacitor count.
''')

course(138,'功率需求與拓撲~Power needs and topology|電磁與熱配置~Electromagnetic and thermal layout|控制與瞬態~Control and transients|效率與可靠度~Efficiency and reliability',
 '共封裝電源的開關損耗、磁性元件與熱路~Switching loss, magnetics and thermal paths in co-packaged power',
 '理想 buck 公式用於教學起點；磁芯非線性、寄生、控制模式與散熱邊界都會改變實際波形。~Ideal buck equations are teaching starting points; magnetic nonlinearity, parasitics, control mode and thermal boundaries alter real waveforms.',
 '假設 5 V 降到 1 V、負載 10 A、效率 90%，輸出 10 W，輸入 11.11 W，總損耗 1.11 W。熱阻假設 15 K/W 時溫升 16.7 K；這不是特定封裝的額定值。~For hypothetical 5-to-1 V conversion, 10 A load and 90% efficiency, output is 10 W, input 11.11 W and loss 1.11 W. At assumed 15 K/W thermal resistance, rise is 16.7 K; this is not a package rating.',
 '電感移到封裝裡就沒有磁芯損耗~Moving the inductor into the package removes core loss|效率相同代表最高接面溫度相同~Equal efficiency implies equal peak junction temperature',
 ['ti-module','q3d'], [('a137','本地儲能支援快於控制迴路的負載變化~Local storage supports load changes faster than the control loop','轉換器需管理開關與磁能，去耦不變換 DC 電壓~Converters manage switching and magnetics; decoupling does not convert DC voltage'),('a139','損耗地圖是散熱蓋與 TIM 的輸入~Loss maps are inputs for lids and TIM','共封裝電源有磁芯與開關分布熱源~Co-packaged power has distributed core and switch heat sources')],r'''
分解負載工作模式~Separate load operating modes|待機、突發與持續負載對效率和瞬態要求不同，單一滿載數值不足。~Idle, burst and sustained loads impose different efficiency and transient requirements.|建立三種負載佔空比與平均能量表。~Build a table of three load duty cycles and average energy.
定義轉換比~Define conversion ratio|理想連續導通 buck 的 D≈Vout/Vin；壓降、死區與不連續模式會使比例偏離。~An ideal continuous-conduction buck has D≈Vout/Vin; losses, dead time and discontinuous modes shift it.|用假想 5 V 至 1 V 系統推得 D=0.2，再列出兩項非理想修正。~For hypothetical 5-to-1 V conversion derive D=0.2 and list two nonideal corrections.
建立磁能預算~Budget magnetic energy|電感儲能為 LI²/2，但磁芯飽和會讓 L 隨電流下降。~Inductor energy is LI²/2, but magnetic saturation makes L decrease with current.|比較常數 L 與電流相依 L 的電流漣波預測。~Compare ripple predictions using constant and current-dependent L.
標示熱點位置~Locate hotspots|共封裝縮短電流路徑，同時把晶片與電感損耗集中於較小面積。~Co-packaging shortens electrical paths while concentrating die and inductor losses into a smaller area.|分別標記晶片導通、開關與磁芯損耗的位置。~Map die conduction, switching and core losses separately.
分析高 di/dt 迴路~Analyze high-di/dt loops|切換回路寄生電感會產生過衝，縮短直線導線不如縮小閉合回路直接。~Switch-loop inductance produces overshoot; shrinking the closed loop is more relevant than trace length alone.|在半橋與輸入電容之間畫出換流環並追蹤回流。~Draw the commutation loop between half bridge and input capacitor, including return.
檢查磁場串擾~Check magnetic coupling|磁性元件漏磁可耦合感測與高速互連，需要空間及頻譜兩種隔離觀點。~Inductor leakage flux can couple into sensing and high-speed links; consider spatial and spectral isolation.|改變受擾回路方向，預測感應雜訊應如何變化。~Rotate a victim loop and predict how induced noise should change.
區分迴路增益與輸出阻抗~Separate loop gain and output impedance|負載瞬態同時受控制頻寬和輸出濾波器影響，不可只靠開關頻率推定。~Load response depends on loop bandwidth and the output filter, not switching frequency alone.|把快負載缺口與較慢回復段分開擬合。~Fit the fast load deficit and slower recovery separately.
檢查遠端感測路徑~Check remote sensing paths|遠端感測改善 DC 壓降，感測噪聲與錯誤接地卻可能擾動控制。~Remote sensing corrects DC drop, but sensing noise and poor reference routing can disturb control.|比較負載端與轉換器端電壓，標明同一參考地。~Compare load-side and converter-side voltage with a common reference.
建立瞬態限界~Build transient bounds|電容先供電而控制迴路稍後接手，過度加大電容也可能改變穩定度。~Capacitance supplies the initial deficit before control responds; excessive capacitance can alter stability.|提出一個負載階躍並分別列出電容與迴路需證明的條件。~Define a load step and separate evidence required from capacitance and control.
驗算效率與溫升~Calculate efficiency and rise|小型模組的低損耗不代表低熱通量；需同時列出功率與散熱面積。~Low module loss does not guarantee low heat flux; report both power and cooling area.|重算 90% 效率算例，改為 95% 比較損耗與溫升。~Recalculate the 90% example at 95% and compare loss and temperature rise.
評估電熱反饋~Evaluate electrothermal feedback|導通電阻、磁芯損耗及電容參數隨溫度變化，固定效率不是完整熱模型。~On-resistance, core loss and capacitor parameters vary with temperature; fixed efficiency is not a complete thermal model.|以熱態損耗回填模型，檢查是否存在收斂平衡點。~Feed hot-state loss back into the model and check for a converged equilibrium.
制定模組驗收矩陣~Define module acceptance matrix|驗收要涵蓋輸入範圍、負載、環境及故障恢復，而非只一張效率曲線。~Acceptance covers input range, load, environment and fault recovery, not only one efficiency curve.|選三個邊界工作點，交付效率、瞬態與最高溫度。~Choose three boundary operating points and deliver efficiency, transient and peak temperature.
''')

course(139,'熱路與界面~Heat paths and interfaces|材料與接觸~Materials and contact|量測與老化~Metrology and aging|多物理驗收~Multiphysics acceptance',
 '熱擴散、接觸熱阻與 TIM 厚度~Heat spreading, contact resistance and TIM thickness',
 'R=t/(kA) 適用均勻一維導熱；局部熱點、接觸粗糙與擴散電阻須另外處理，不能用材料 k 直接替代整組封裝表現。~R=t/(kA) assumes uniform one-dimensional conduction; hotspots, rough contact and spreading resistance require additional treatment.',
 '假設 TIM 厚 50 μm、k=5 W/(m·K)、面積 100 mm²，R=0.1 K/W；20 W 導熱造成 2 K 溫差。厚度 ±10 μm 使此項 R 為 0.08–0.12 K/W，未含接觸。~Assume TIM thickness 50 μm, k=5 W/(m·K), area 100 mm²: R=0.1 K/W, giving 2 K at 20 W. Thickness ±10 μm yields 0.08–0.12 K/W, excluding contact resistance.',
 '熱導率最高的材料一定有最低組裝熱阻~The highest-conductivity material always gives the lowest assembled resistance|接面溫度可用散熱蓋表面溫度直接代替~Lid surface temperature directly equals junction temperature',
 ['ti-module','imec-cooling'], [('a140','熱阻網路可定位液冷前的界面瓶頸~Thermal networks locate interface bottlenecks upstream of liquid cooling','TIM 是固體接觸問題，微流道還需壓降與泵功~TIM is a solid-contact problem; microchannels add pressure drop and pump power'),('a186','CTE 與界面壓力連到光子封裝變形~CTE and contact pressure link to photonic-package deformation','光子封裝還需將變形換算耦光與相位漂移~Photonics additionally maps deformation into coupling and phase drift')],r'''
建立熱源地圖~Build a heat-source map|面平均功率會掩蓋局部高熱通量，散熱蓋需把局部熱量展開。~Area-average power hides local heat flux; the lid must spread localized heat.|用相同總功率畫均勻及集中兩種熱源，比較最高溫度。~Draw uniform and concentrated sources with equal power and compare peak temperature.
劃分串並聯熱路~Separate series and parallel heat paths|熱可經蓋、基板與互連離開，串聯總和只適用同一熱流通過的分支。~Heat can leave through lid, substrate and interconnects; series sums apply only along a common heat-flow branch.|畫含上方與下方散熱的熱阻網路，檢查能量守恆。~Draw upper and lower cooling branches and check energy conservation.
辨識擴散熱阻~Identify spreading resistance|小熱源向大散熱蓋擴散產生三維溫度場，不能以整片面積硬套一維式。~A small source spreading into a large lid creates a 3D temperature field; full-area 1D formulas can mislead.|比較熱源尺寸改變但蓋面積不變的兩案例。~Compare two source sizes with the same lid area.
選擇界面材料~Select interface materials|填料提高有效導熱可能同時改變黏度、順應性與泵出行為。~Filler can raise conductivity while changing viscosity, compliance and pump-out behavior.|以導熱、可壓縮性與長期穩定度三軸比較候選材料。~Compare candidates on conductivity, compressibility and long-term stability.
控制鍵合層厚度~Control bond-line thickness|厚度降低可減少體熱阻，過薄卻可能無法填平翹曲及表面粗糙。~Thinner layers reduce bulk resistance but may fail to fill warpage and roughness.|標記最薄與最厚位置，檢查是否存在乾接觸區。~Mark minimum and maximum thickness and inspect for dry contact regions.
考慮接觸壓力~Consider contact pressure|壓力改善實際接觸面積，但過大壓力會增加晶片與光纖結構風險。~Pressure improves real contact area but excessive loading risks die and fiber structures.|將壓力、熱阻與變形列於同一張權衡圖。~Plot pressure, thermal resistance and deformation on a common tradeoff chart.
校正溫度量測~Calibrate temperature measurement|紅外表觀溫度受放射率影響，金屬反射可造成假熱點或假冷點。~Infrared apparent temperature depends on emissivity; metal reflections can create false hot or cold spots.|以獨立溫度感測點驗證一個 IR 區域。~Validate one IR region with an independent temperature sensor.
估計界面熱阻~Estimate interface resistance|量測溫差除以穿越界面的熱流才是熱阻；輸入電功率未必全部穿過該面。~Resistance is temperature drop divided by heat through the interface; electrical input need not all cross that face.|建立能量平衡，扣除其他熱路後重算熱阻。~Close the energy balance and recalculate after accounting for other paths.
追蹤泵出與乾涸~Track pump-out and dry-out|熱循環與黏彈性造成 TIM 位移，初始低熱阻不代表長期穩定。~Thermal cycling and viscoelasticity move TIM; low initial resistance does not prove long-term stability.|比較循環前後的厚度分布、熱阻與空洞位置。~Compare thickness maps, resistance and void positions before and after cycling.
驗算厚度敏感度~Calculate thickness sensitivity|一維模型的熱阻與厚度成正比，接觸主導時卻未必呈同一比例。~A 1D bulk resistance scales with thickness, unlike a contact-dominated interface.|重算 50 μm 算例並加入假想 0.05 K/W 接觸項。~Recalculate the 50 μm example and add a hypothetical 0.05 K/W contact term.
檢查 CTE 不匹配~Check CTE mismatch|散熱蓋、晶片與黏著層膨脹不同，翹曲會回頭改變接觸壓力。~Lid, die and adhesive expand differently; warpage feeds back into contact pressure.|比較冷熱兩態接觸區，辨別熱與機械模型的交接量。~Compare cold and hot contact areas and identify thermal-mechanical coupling variables.
交付界面放行資料~Deliver interface release evidence|良率判斷需涵蓋熱阻散布、厚度分布與老化後漂移，非只供應商 k 值。~Yield assessment needs resistance spread, thickness distribution and aging drift, not just vendor k.|為熱、機械與材料資料各列一項尚未解決的不確定度。~List one unresolved uncertainty each in thermal, mechanical and material data.
''')

course(140,'熱液需求~Thermal-fluid requirements|通道與集流~Channels and manifolds|耦合驗證~Coupled validation|系統可靠度~System reliability',
 '微流道對流、壓降、熱點與泵功~Microchannel convection, pressure drop, hotspots and pump power',
 '單相穩態水流算例不涵蓋沸騰、氣泡堵塞與冷卻液材料相容性；製作和加壓測試需專業設備。~Single-phase steady-water examples exclude boiling, bubble blockage and coolant compatibility; fabrication and pressurized testing require professional equipment.',
 '假設水的質量流率 0.005 kg/s、比熱 4180 J/(kg·K)、熱負載 100 W，出口升溫 ΔT=4.78 K。若壓降 50 kPa、體積流率 5×10⁻⁶ m³/s，液壓功 0.25 W，泵電功還須除以效率。~Assume water flow 0.005 kg/s, heat capacity 4180 J/(kg·K) and heat 100 W: outlet rise is 4.78 K. At 50 kPa and 5×10⁻⁶ m³/s, hydraulic power is 0.25 W; divide by pump efficiency for electrical input.',
 '通道愈窄總系統能耗必定愈低~Narrower channels always reduce total system energy|冷卻液出口溫度就是晶片最高溫度~Coolant outlet temperature equals peak chip temperature',
 ['imec-cooling','imec-cold'], [('a139','用熱阻分解檢查 TIM 是否仍是瓶頸~Use resistance decomposition to check whether TIM remains the bottleneck','流道可增加對流效率但需要液壓設計~Channels improve convection but require hydraulic design'),('a132','局部熱點資料決定 3D 堆疊冷卻位置~Hotspot maps determine cooling locations in 3D stacks','3D 內層還受互連密度與密封界面限制~Inner 3D layers additionally face interconnect-density and sealing constraints')],r'''
定義熱通量分布~Define heat-flux distribution|熱點位置比平均功率更能決定通道需求，上游與下游溫差也不可忽略。~Hotspot locations can govern channel needs more strongly than average power; upstream-downstream gradients matter.|畫一個集中熱點，分別置於入口及出口比較。~Place the same hotspot near inlet and outlet and compare.
作質量與能量守恆~Apply mass and energy conservation|穩態單相流中 Q=ṁcpΔT 可交叉檢查熱量是否完整進入冷卻液。~For steady single-phase flow, Q=ṁcpΔT cross-checks heat transferred into coolant.|列出壁面、流體及環境熱損，完成能量平衡。~List wall, fluid and ambient heat terms and close the energy balance.
辨識流動區域~Identify flow regime|雷諾數需使用水力直徑及平均速度，矩形通道不能直接用寬度代替所有尺度。~Reynolds number uses hydraulic diameter and mean velocity; channel width alone is insufficient.|從截面面積與潤濕周長算 Dh=4A/P。~Compute Dh=4A/P from cross-sectional area and wetted perimeter.
配置平行流道~Arrange parallel channels|平行通道不保證平均分流，入口歧管壓力分布可能使局部缺水。~Parallel channels do not guarantee equal flow; manifold pressure variation can starve channels.|以阻力網路分配三條流道，增加一條阻力觀察重分配。~Allocate three channels using a resistance network and increase one resistance.
平衡傳熱與壓降~Balance heat transfer and pressure drop|增加表面積可能提高傳熱，同時增加摩擦壓降和泵能耗。~More surface area may improve heat transfer while raising frictional drop and pumping cost.|將熱阻與液壓功置於同一圖，不只排名最低熱阻。~Plot thermal resistance against hydraulic power rather than ranking resistance alone.
檢查密封界面~Check sealing interfaces|接合層、通孔與接頭都是可能漏點，冷卻效果與密封完整性是獨立要求。~Bond layers, vias and fittings are possible leak paths; cooling and sealing are independent requirements.|畫出濕區與電路區邊界，列每個穿越界面的密封證據。~Draw wet and electrical regions and list sealing evidence for each crossing.
驗證溫度場~Validate temperature fields|流體出口平均溫度不能代表晶片峰值，需把固體導熱和流體對流連接。~Mean outlet temperature is not peak die temperature; couple solid conduction to fluid convection.|比較兩種熱點形狀，保持總熱量及流量相同。~Compare two hotspot shapes at identical total heat and flow.
評估網格與入口條件~Assess mesh and inlet conditions|入口發展區及邊界層需要解析，完全發展假設可能低估局部差異。~Entrance development and boundary layers require resolution; fully developed assumptions can miss local variation.|改變入口長度與網格密度，追蹤壓降與峰溫收斂。~Vary entrance length and mesh density, tracking pressure-drop and peak-temperature convergence.
核對泵功~Check pump power|液壓功為 Δp·V̇，實際電功還包括效率及控制損失。~Hydraulic power is Δp·V̇; electrical input also includes efficiency and control losses.|重算算例，若效率 50%，指出泵電功為 0.5 W。~Recalculate the example; at 50% efficiency, identify 0.5 W pump input.
分析氣泡與堵塞~Analyze bubbles and blockage|單條堵塞會改變分流和局部溫升，平均流量讀值未必顯示危險熱點。~One blocked channel redistributes flow and local temperature; average flow may conceal a hotspot.|在流阻網路封閉一支路，畫失效前後熱路。~Close one branch in the resistance network and compare heat paths.
規劃材料相容性~Plan material compatibility|冷卻液、金屬、聚合物與黏著界面需共同考慮腐蝕、滲透與析出。~Coolant, metals, polymers and adhesives must be checked for corrosion, permeation and precipitation.|列出材料配對與長期浸泡需觀察的指標。~List material pairs and observations required during long-term soak testing.
提交系統權衡~Submit a system tradeoff|冷卻設計放行需同時報最高溫度、泵能耗、密封及單一失效應對。~Cooling acceptance requires peak temperature, pumping energy, sealing and single-failure response.|交付正常與堵塞兩工況，清楚區分假設及實測資料。~Deliver normal and blocked conditions, separating assumptions from measured data.
''')

course(141,'封裝與氣體~Package and gas|密封結構~Seal structures|漏率量測~Leak metrology|壽命與驗收~Life and acceptance','腔體漏率、滲透與細漏/粗漏~Cavity leakage, permeation and fine/gross leak tests','氦等效漏率不能不經轉換就當成實際空氣或水汽漏率；測試門檻須依腔體容積、氣體及用途設定。~Helium-equivalent leak rates are not automatically air or moisture leak rates; limits depend on cavity volume, gas and application.','假設腔體 V=0.1 cm³、定常氣體通量 Q=10⁻⁹ atm·cm³/s，忽略吸附及壓差變化，1 天壓升為 Qt/V=8.64×10⁻⁴ atm；這只是初始線性上限模型。~For V=0.1 cm³ and constant throughput Q=10⁻⁹ atm·cm³/s, neglecting adsorption and pressure changes, one-day rise is Qt/V=8.64×10⁻⁴ atm. This is an initial linear model.','氦細漏合格即可省略粗漏檢查~Passing helium fine leak eliminates the need for gross-leak screening|氣密表示完全沒有內部放氣~Hermetic means no internal outgassing',['nasa-hermetic','nasa-pem'],[('a142','漏率與腔體容積決定真空保持~Leak rate and cavity volume govern vacuum retention','真空器件還要控制放氣與吸氣劑~Vacuum devices also need outgassing and getter control'),('a147','兩者都追蹤水汽進入與失效~Both trace moisture ingress and failure','塑膠滲透與金屬封口漏孔是不同傳輸機制~Polymer permeation differs from a metal-seal leak path')],r'''
定義氣密邊界~Define hermetic boundary|腔體、蓋板與穿通件共同形成密封邊界。~Cavity, lid and feedthroughs jointly define the seal.|逐一標出焊縫及電氣穿越處。~Mark each seam and electrical crossing.
區分洩漏與滲透~Separate leakage and permeation|裂縫流動與材料擴散具有不同時間與氣體依賴性。~Crack flow and material diffusion have different time and gas dependences.|對照快速漏入與慢速濃度上升。~Compare fast ingress with slow concentration rise.
盤點內部水汽~Inventory internal moisture|初始殘水與材料放氣可使不漏的腔體仍有污染。~Residual water and outgassing can contaminate a nonleaking cavity.|把外來漏入與內部來源分表。~Tabulate external ingress and internal sources separately.
辨識封口材料~Identify seal materials|膨脹失配可在熱循環後打開原本密合的界面。~Expansion mismatch can open an initially intact interface after cycling.|畫冷熱兩態接縫受力。~Draw seam loads in cold and hot states.
檢查穿通件~Inspect feedthroughs|導線、光纖與玻璃金屬界面可成為獨立漏道。~Wires, fibers and glass-metal interfaces can each form leak paths.|設計逐區定位測試而非只量整包。~Plan regional localization rather than only whole-package testing.
設定腔體容積~Determine cavity volume|相同漏率在小腔體造成更快壓力或濃度變化。~The same leak produces faster pressure or concentration change in a smaller cavity.|將容積減半，重算壓升。~Halve volume and recalculate pressure rise.
先辨粗漏~Screen gross leaks first|大漏可能讓示蹤氣體在量測前流失，導致細漏假陰性。~A gross leak can lose tracer before measurement, causing a fine-leak false negative.|列出示蹤注入與量測延遲造成的偏差。~List biases from tracer charging and measurement delay.
校正細漏儀~Calibrate fine-leak instrumentation|標準漏孔、背景與量測時間共同決定檢出能力。~Reference leaks, background and timing determine detection capability.|用空白及標準漏孔建立可辨識範圍。~Use blank and reference leak to establish detectable range.
正確使用單位~Use leak units correctly|漏率常是壓力乘體積除時間，不是單純體積流率。~Leak throughput often has pressure-volume/time units, not volume/time alone.|檢查算例 Qt/V 的量綱。~Check dimensions of Qt/V in the example.
估計壓力演化~Estimate pressure evolution|固定通量近似在壓差明顯改變時失效。~Constant-throughput approximation fails when pressure difference changes appreciably.|標出線性算例何時需改用壓差相依模型。~Identify when the linear example needs a pressure-dependent model.
熱循環再測~Retest after thermal cycling|初始漏率合格不能證明封口經應力後仍穩定。~Initial leak compliance does not prove stability after stress.|比較前後漏率與接縫顯微影像。~Compare before/after leakage and seam microscopy.
建立氣密證據鏈~Build hermetic evidence chain|放行需保留氣體、容積、延遲、背景及校正紀錄。~Release requires gas, volume, delay, background and calibration records.|讓同學重算一份漏率報告。~Have a peer reconstruct one leak report.
''')

course(142,'真空用途~Vacuum purpose|接合與放氣~Bonding and outgassing|壓力與吸氣~Pressure and getters|長期保持~Long-term retention','微腔真空、氣體負載與吸氣劑~Microcavity vacuum, gas load and getters','P=Q/S 為穩態集中模型；微腔氣體成分、吸附、吸氣容量和封口時間歷史會改變結果。~P=Q/S is a steady lumped model; gas species, adsorption, getter capacity and sealing history change microcavity behavior.','假設總氣體負載 Q=2×10⁻¹⁰ mbar·L/s，有效抽速 S=10⁻⁷ L/s，P=2×10⁻³ mbar；抽速衰減一半時壓力加倍。封閉後吸氣劑不等同永久外接幫浦。~For Q=2×10⁻¹⁰ mbar·L/s and effective speed S=10⁻⁷ L/s, P=2×10⁻³ mbar; halving speed doubles pressure. A sealed getter is not an unlimited external pump.','真空接合後壓力永遠固定~Pressure stays fixed forever after vacuum bonding|吸氣劑能等效率吸收所有氣體~A getter pumps every gas equally',['nasa-hermetic','nordson'],[('a141','漏率與密封證據直接轉移~Leak and sealing evidence transfers directly','真空封裝更加依賴腔內殘氣與吸附~Vacuum packaging depends more strongly on residual gas and adsorption'),('a149','聲學可檢視接合完整性~Acoustics can inspect bond integrity','接合影像不能直接給出真空壓力~Bond images do not directly measure vacuum pressure')],r'''
連結器件與真空需求~Connect device to vacuum need|氣體阻尼會改變 MEMS 共振品質因子，但 Q 值也受固體損耗影響。~Gas damping affects MEMS quality factor, but solid losses also affect Q.|列出不能由 Q 值單獨分辨的損耗。~List losses that Q alone cannot distinguish.
劃分腔體與通道~Map cavity and channels|小容積對微量放氣敏感，連通通道影響有效抽速。~Small volumes are sensitive to outgassing; channels limit effective pumping speed.|畫腔體、密封環與排氣路徑。~Draw cavity, seal ring and evacuation path.
設定氣體負載表~Build a gas-load table|外漏、滲透、解吸與反應產氣應分開估計。~Separate leakage, permeation, desorption and reaction gas loads.|對每項列出可用量測及未知量。~List measurements and unknowns for each load.
評估接合相容性~Assess bond compatibility|封口熱歷史會影響元件、金屬與吸氣層，不只影響接合強度。~Sealing thermal history affects devices, metals and getters, not only bond strength.|製作材料與熱歷史交叉矩陣。~Build a material-versus-thermal-history matrix.
減少內表面放氣~Reduce internal outgassing|表面積對容積比高，使表面殘留成為微腔的重要氣源。~High surface-to-volume ratio makes surface residues a major microcavity gas source.|比較等容積不同內面積的兩腔體。~Compare equal-volume cavities with different internal areas.
檢查密封環連續性~Check seal-ring continuity|局部未接合可能形成穿越密封環的連續通路。~Local unbonded regions may connect across a seal ring.|區分孤立空洞與連通漏道。~Distinguish isolated voids from connected leaks.
選擇吸氣機制~Select getter mechanism|吸氣能力有氣體選擇性與容量限制，不能以覆蓋面積直接保證壽命。~Getter action is species-selective and capacity-limited; area alone cannot guarantee life.|把氣體負載與可吸收成分對照。~Match gas loads to species the getter can pump.
計算有效抽速~Calculate effective speed|通道導通率與吸氣表面速度串聯限制有效抽速。~Channel conductance and getter surface speed jointly limit effective pumping.|比較高吸氣速度但窄通道的案例。~Compare a fast getter connected through a narrow channel.
推估腔內壓力~Estimate cavity pressure|器件校正曲線可間接估壓，但溫度及其他阻尼需分離。~Device calibration can infer pressure only after separating temperature and other damping.|用兩種獨立指標交叉驗證壓力趨勢。~Cross-check pressure trends with two independent observables.
驗算負載與抽速~Calculate load and speed|穩態壓力由負載除抽速決定，但吸氣耗盡後不再維持。~Steady pressure is load divided by speed, but getter exhaustion breaks that equilibrium.|重算 Q/S 算例並將 Q 加倍。~Recalculate Q/S with doubled gas load.
加速與實際壽命~Relate accelerated and service life|加溫可能改變放氣與漏入機制，不能直接把時間倍率當普適常數。~Heating can change outgassing and ingress mechanisms; acceleration factors are not universal.|比較壓力漂移與氣體來源是否一致。~Check whether pressure drift retains the same gas source.
交付真空保持資料~Deliver vacuum-retention evidence|初始壓力、漂移速率、密封與吸氣容量需共同報告。~Report initial pressure, drift, sealing and getter capacity together.|列一項可能導致錯估壽命的未量測氣體。~Name an unmeasured gas that could bias life prediction.
''')

course(143,'接合機制~Bond mechanisms|孔隙與界面~Porosity and interfaces|熱機量測~Thermomechanical metrology|老化與判定~Aging and decisions','銀燒結頸部、孔隙與界面可靠度~Silver sinter necks, porosity and interface reliability','材料廠建議是特定配方的範圍；本課不給通用壓力溫度配方，孔隙率也不能單獨預測疲勞壽命。~Vendor windows apply to specific formulations; no universal pressure-temperature recipe is supplied, and porosity alone does not predict fatigue life.','假設接合層厚 30 μm、有效 k=150 W/(m·K)、面積 25 mm²，體熱阻為 0.008 K/W；100 W 時溫差 0.8 K。實際仍需加入上下界面與擴散熱阻。~For thickness 30 μm, effective k=150 W/(m·K), area 25 mm², bulk resistance is 0.008 K/W and drop is 0.8 K at 100 W. Interfaces and spreading remain additional.','銀燒結一定完全無孔隙~Silver sintering is always pore-free|室溫剪切強度可直接代替熱循環壽命~Room-temperature shear strength directly replaces thermal-cycle life',['heraeus','nasa-fatigue'],[('a144','低接合熱阻支援雙面散熱~Low bond resistance supports double-sided cooling','雙面結構會增加機械約束與應力~Double-sided structures increase mechanical constraint'),('a145','銀層與陶瓷金屬化界面共同傳熱~Silver and metallized ceramic interfaces conduct heat together','DBC 是覆銅陶瓷，銀燒結是另一個接合界面~DBC is copper-clad ceramic; silver sinter is a separate bond')],r'''
辨識固態燒結~Identify solid-state sintering|顆粒間形成頸部及緻密化，不等同焊料液相凝固。~Particle necking and densification differ from solder solidification.|畫顆粒、頸部及殘餘孔隙。~Draw particles, necks and residual pores.
確認表面金屬化~Check surface metallization|表面污染和金屬化相容性會限制接合，即使銀層本身導熱高。~Contamination and metallization compatibility can limit bonding despite conductive silver.|列出上下表面與界面分析方法。~List both surfaces and interface analysis methods.
盤點機械約束~Map mechanical constraints|晶片、基板及夾持邊界決定燒結後殘餘應力。~Die, substrate and fixture boundaries govern residual stress.|區分製程負荷與服役熱應力。~Separate process loading from service thermal stress.
分析孔隙形貌~Analyze pore morphology|相同孔隙率可有不同連通性與裂紋萌生風險。~Equal porosity can have different connectivity and crack-initiation risk.|比較細分散孔隙與集中大空洞。~Compare fine dispersed pores with a large clustered void.
量測厚度均勻性~Measure thickness uniformity|局部厚度會改變熱阻與剪切應變分布。~Local thickness changes thermal resistance and shear strain.|作厚度地圖並標出晶片邊緣。~Map thickness and mark die edges.
辨識材料搬移~Identify material movement|乾燥、收縮及擠流可能改變覆蓋範圍，印刷量不等於最終有效面積。~Drying, shrinkage and squeeze flow change coverage; deposited volume is not final bonded area.|比較接合前後覆蓋邊界。~Compare coverage boundaries before and after bonding.
分離體與界面熱阻~Separate bulk and interface resistance|高體導熱不能消除上下界面未接合造成的熱阻。~High bulk conductivity cannot remove resistance from unbonded interfaces.|把接合層與兩界面分成三項。~Separate bond bulk and both interfaces into three terms.
判讀剪切試驗~Interpret shear testing|破壞位置能區分界面弱化與銀層內聚破壞，僅看峰值力不足。~Failure location distinguishes interface weakness from cohesive failure; peak force alone is insufficient.|同時報剪切面積與斷口位置。~Report sheared area and fracture location together.
交叉聲學與截面~Cross-check acoustics and sections|非破壞影像的暗亮區不等同精確孔隙率，需對應截面證據。~Acoustic contrast is not exact porosity; correlate with section evidence.|選同一座標做影像配準。~Register both methods at the same coordinates.
驗算熱路~Calculate thermal path|t/(kA) 是體層近似，局部缺陷使熱流偏離均勻。~t/(kA) approximates the bulk layer; defects make heat flow nonuniform.|重算 0.008 K/W 算例並比較有效面積减半。~Recalculate 0.008 K/W and halve effective area.
追蹤疲勞裂紋~Track fatigue cracks|功率循環與環境熱循環的溫度梯度不同，不能混用壽命資料。~Power and ambient thermal cycling have different gradients; their life data are not interchangeable.|記錄熱源位置及每循環溫度歷史。~Record heat-source position and cycle temperature history.
制定接合放行~Define bond acceptance|熱阻、機械證據與老化後變化需要互相支持。~Thermal, mechanical and post-aging evidence must support each other.|提出一組強度高但熱阻異常的調查路徑。~Plan an investigation for high strength but abnormal thermal resistance.
''')

course(144,'雙熱路設計~Dual heat paths|電氣與機械~Electrical and mechanical|熱場與變形~Thermal fields and deformation|可靠度證據~Reliability evidence','雙面散熱熱阻分配、電氣隔離與機械約束~Double-sided heat sharing, isolation and mechanical constraint','兩支路並聯公式假設相同參考溫度及集中熱源；不對稱流體溫度和空間熱點需用完整網路。~Parallel resistance assumes equal reference temperatures and a lumped source; unequal coolants and hotspots need a full network.','假設上下熱路皆 0.4 K/W 且冷板等溫，等效 0.2 K/W；100 W 熱源升溫 20 K、每側 50 W。若一側變成 0.8 K/W，等效 0.267 K/W，熱分配不再相等。~With two 0.4 K/W paths and equal cold-plate temperatures, equivalent resistance is 0.2 K/W; 100 W yields 20 K rise and 50 W per side. If one path becomes 0.8 K/W, equivalent resistance is 0.267 K/W and sharing is unequal.','雙面散熱永遠剛好降低一半接面溫度~Double-sided cooling always halves junction temperature|散熱更好就不必驗證絕緣~Better cooling eliminates isolation verification',['ti-module','rogers-dbc'],[('a143','低熱阻接合支援上下導熱~Low-resistance bonds support top and bottom heat flow','雙面約束會改變接合應變~Dual-side constraint changes bond strain'),('a140','冷板邊界可接微流道模型~Cold-plate boundaries connect to microchannel models','雙面功率模組還需高壓隔離~Double-sided power modules additionally need electrical isolation')],r'''
定義上下熱出口~Define upper and lower exits|雙面可增加散熱路徑，但兩側未必同溫或等效。~Two sides add heat paths but need not be isothermal or equivalent.|分別列出兩側冷卻邊界。~List cooling boundaries separately for each side.
畫出熱阻分支~Draw thermal branches|共享晶片熱源與不同串聯界面構成並聯網路。~A shared die source and distinct series interfaces form parallel branches.|標出每一支路的接合與絕緣層。~Mark bonds and insulating layers in each branch.
檢查電流路徑~Check current paths|上方導體或間隔柱同時參與導電和導熱，幾何需共同設計。~Top conductors or spacers carry both current and heat; geometry must be co-designed.|在熱路圖旁疊加換流環。~Overlay the commutation loop alongside the thermal map.
選擇電氣隔離層~Select isolation layers|高導熱不能替代耐壓與局部放電性能。~Thermal conductivity does not replace dielectric and partial-discharge performance.|列出熱、電場與厚度三個約束。~List thermal, electric-field and thickness constraints.
管理堆疊共平面~Manage stack coplanarity|不同高度會造成接觸不均與局部過載。~Height differences cause uneven contact and local overload.|用假想高度地圖辨識先接觸區。~Use a hypothetical height map to identify first-contact regions.
分析裝配壓力~Analyze assembly pressure|兩面夾持限制自由熱膨脹，可能提高晶片邊緣應力。~Clamping both faces restricts free expansion and can raise die-edge stress.|比較自由及雙面約束的變形方向。~Compare free and dual-constrained deformation.
分配上下熱流~Allocate heat sharing|熱流分配取決於各支路熱阻及冷端溫度。~Heat sharing depends on branch resistance and cold-side temperature.|解算等冷端算例，再改一側冷端升溫。~Solve the equal-cold-side example, then warm one cold side.
檢查局部溫度梯度~Check local gradients|平均接面溫度降低不代表晶片內梯度也降低。~Lower average junction temperature does not guarantee lower intradie gradient.|比較上下接觸不均的熱點位置。~Compare hotspots under asymmetric contact.
量測結構函數~Measure transient thermal response|暫態熱阻包含多時間尺度，單一穩態值無法定位所有界面。~Transient impedance contains multiple timescales; one steady value cannot locate every interface.|對照熱脈衝早晚期的響應。~Compare early and late heat-pulse responses.
模擬單側劣化~Simulate one-side degradation|一側界面劣化會將熱流轉移至另一側並改變應力。~One degraded interface redistributes heat and stress to the other side.|將一支路熱阻加倍，重算溫升及分流。~Double one resistance and recalculate rise and sharing.
比較熱循環與功率循環~Compare thermal and power cycling|環境加熱與晶片自發熱形成不同梯度與疲勞負荷。~Ambient heating and die self-heating produce different gradients and fatigue loads.|建立兩種循環的溫度歷史。~Construct temperature histories for both cycles.
交付共同驗收~Deliver joint acceptance|熱、絕緣、機械與老化條件都需有證據。~Thermal, isolation, mechanical and aging requirements each need evidence.|為每條件指定量測與保留疑問。~Assign a measurement and open question to each requirement.
''')

course(145,'陶瓷與覆銅~Ceramic and copper|圖案與應力~Patterns and stress|電熱驗證~Electrothermal validation|界面壽命~Interface life','DBC 陶瓷絕緣、銅層擴散及邊缘應力~DBC insulation, copper heat spreading and edge stress','資料表典型 k 和耐壓只適用所列測試條件；DBC、AMB 與薄膜金屬化不可視為同一製程。~Datasheet conductivity and breakdown values apply to stated conditions; DBC, AMB and thin-film metallization are distinct processes.','假設 AlN 厚 0.63 mm、k=170 W/(m·K)、有效面積 100 mm²，陶瓷一維 R=0.0371 K/W；50 W 時 ΔT=1.85 K，不含銅擴散與界面。~For hypothetical AlN thickness 0.63 mm, k=170 W/(m·K), area 100 mm², 1D ceramic resistance is 0.0371 K/W; 50 W gives 1.85 K, excluding copper spreading and interfaces.','所有陶瓷基板都使用同一覆銅機制~All ceramic substrates use the same copper-bonding mechanism|陶瓷耐壓等於整個模組耐壓~Ceramic breakdown voltage equals module isolation rating',['rogers-dbc','rogers-thermal'],[('a143','金屬化面是燒結接合的基礎~Metallized surfaces support sintered bonds','陶瓷裂紋與銀層孔隙要分開判讀~Ceramic cracks and silver porosity require separate diagnosis'),('a144','DBC 兼顧絕緣與雙面導熱~DBC supports insulation and dual-side heat flow','雙面模組新增上下裝配約束~Dual-side modules add top-bottom assembly constraints')],r'''
辨識 DBC 結構~Identify DBC structure|陶瓷提供電氣隔離，銅層提供導電與橫向熱擴散。~Ceramic provides isolation; copper provides conduction and lateral heat spreading.|畫銅陶瓷銅截面並標功能。~Draw a copper-ceramic-copper section and label functions.
比較陶瓷材料~Compare ceramics|Al₂O₃、AlN 與 Si₃N₄ 在導熱及韌性間有不同權衡。~Al₂O₃, AlN and Si₃N₄ trade conductivity against toughness differently.|只用同條件資料比較性能。~Compare properties only under matched conditions.
區分接合技術~Distinguish bonding technologies|DBC 與活性金屬釬焊的界面形成機制不同。~DBC and active-metal brazing form interfaces by different mechanisms.|為每種技術列界面材料與來源。~List interface materials and sources for each technology.
分配銅圖案~Allocate copper patterns|不對稱覆銅使熱膨脹彎矩不平衡，增加翹曲。~Asymmetric copper patterns unbalance thermal bending moments and increase warpage.|比較對稱與偏心銅覆蓋。~Compare symmetric and offset copper coverage.
管理銅邊緣~Manage copper edges|銅陶瓷邊緣可能集中熱機應力及電場。~Copper-ceramic edges can concentrate thermomechanical stress and electric field.|圈出邊角及電位差最大的區域。~Mark corners and regions of largest potential difference.
保留絕緣間距~Preserve isolation distances|爬電路徑、空氣間隙與陶瓷厚度限制不同失效。~Creepage, clearance and ceramic thickness constrain different failures.|用剖面區分三種距離。~Distinguish the three distances in a section.
驗算厚度熱阻~Calculate thickness resistance|增加陶瓷厚度改善某些電氣邊界，卻增加一維熱阻。~Thicker ceramic can improve some electrical margins while increasing 1D thermal resistance.|重算 0.63 mm 算例並加倍厚度。~Recalculate the 0.63 mm example at double thickness.
分析熱擴散面積~Analyze spreading area|實際有效傳熱面積受熱源及銅厚影響，不一定等於整片基板。~Effective thermal area depends on source and copper thickness, not necessarily full substrate area.|比較小晶片與大晶片的熱流展開。~Compare spreading from small and large dies.
量測界面完整性~Measure interface integrity|局部剝離增加熱阻並重分配應力，外觀完整不能排除。~Local delamination raises resistance and redistributes stress despite intact appearance.|結合聲學地圖與熱阻變化。~Correlate acoustic maps with thermal-resistance changes.
追蹤陶瓷裂紋~Track ceramic cracks|陶瓷脆裂需關注缺陷及拉應力，平均壓縮不能排除局部拉伸。~Brittle fracture depends on flaws and tensile stress; average compression does not exclude local tension.|找出邊角拉應力與裂紋方向。~Locate edge tension and crack direction.
設計循環比較~Design cycling comparisons|銅厚與陶瓷厚度一起改變疲勞負荷，不能只比循環次數。~Copper and ceramic thickness jointly affect fatigue; cycle counts alone are insufficient.|保持循環條件，僅改一個幾何變數。~Keep cycling conditions fixed and change one geometric variable.
交付基板選型~Deliver substrate selection|選型需熱、電、機械及製造相容證據。~Selection needs thermal, electrical, mechanical and manufacturing evidence.|對候選基板列出適用與不可外推條件。~List validity and non-extrapolation conditions for each candidate.
''')

course(146,'任務與循環~Mission and cycles|熱應變與監測~Thermal strain and monitoring|統計與失效~Statistics and failure|外推與驗收~Extrapolation and acceptance','溫度循環歷史、CTE 失配及失效統計~Thermal-cycle history, CTE mismatch and failure statistics','加速試驗僅在機制相同時支持外推；零失效不等於無限壽命，環境熱循環與功率循環也不可直接互換。~Accelerated tests support extrapolation only with unchanged mechanisms; zero failures do not imply infinite life, and ambient and power cycling are distinct.','假設 Δα=10 ppm/K、ΔT=100 K、離中性點距離 5 mm，自由失配位移為 5 μm；接頭高 100 μm 時名義剪應變 0.05，未含彎曲與塑性鬆弛。~For Δα=10 ppm/K, ΔT=100 K and distance from neutral point 5 mm, free mismatch is 5 μm; at joint height 100 μm nominal shear strain is 0.05, excluding bending and plastic relaxation.','零失效樣品可以證明永不失效~Zero failed samples prove infinite life|相同 ΔT 就代表相同疲勞條件~Equal ΔT means identical fatigue conditions',['nasa-fatigue','nasa-cycling'],[('a148','循環溫度史可輸入焊點疲勞模型~Cycle temperature histories feed solder-fatigue models','試驗觀察需先確认失效機制才可校準模型~Test failures need mechanism confirmation before calibration'),('a147','預處理水分可能改變循環失效~Moisture preconditioning can change cycle failure','濕氣與熱失配需要分因子設計~Moisture and mismatch need factorial separation')],r'''
定義服役溫度史~Define service thermal history|幅度、平均溫度、停留與升降速率都影響損傷。~Amplitude, mean temperature, dwell and ramp all affect damage.|列完整時間軸而非只寫高低溫。~Record a full timeline, not only extremes.
挑選代表樣品~Select representative samples|材料批次與組裝位置造成群體差異，便利取樣可能低估散布。~Material lot and assembly location cause variation; convenience sampling can hide it.|跨批次安排樣品與對照。~Distribute samples and controls across lots.
建立初始基線~Establish baseline|初始電阻及影像讓後續變化可追溯，不合格來料需分開。~Initial resistance and images anchor drift; incoming defects need separation.|保存序號、初始阻值及同座標影像。~Save serial IDs, baseline resistance and registered images.
計算失配位移~Calculate mismatch displacement|自由 CTE 位移是負荷起點，實際應變受結構順應性調整。~Free CTE mismatch starts the load estimate; structural compliance alters actual strain.|驗算 5 μm 範例並將距離加倍。~Check the 5 μm example and double distance.
分辨停留效應~Distinguish dwell effects|焊料在高溫停留可能蠕變鬆弛，損伤取決於時間。~Solder can creep and relax during hot dwell; damage is time-dependent.|比較相同 ΔT、不同停留的兩循環。~Compare equal-ΔT cycles with different dwell.
規劃連續監測~Plan continuous monitoring|間歇開路可能在回到室溫後消失，離線讀值會漏掉。~Intermittent opens may disappear at room temperature and evade offline readings.|設定電阻事件與持續時間的定義。~Define resistance-event magnitude and duration.
定位首發失效~Locate first failure|串聯菊鏈只指出某段異常，不能直接識別每個焊點。~A daisy chain identifies a faulty segment, not automatically the individual joint.|結合分段測試與影像縮小位置。~Combine segmented testing and imaging to localize.
記錄設限樣品~Record censored samples|試驗結束仍正常的樣品是右設限，不可當成在終點失效。~Survivors at test end are right-censored, not failures at that time.|分開失效時間與設限時間。~Separate failure times from censoring times.
比較分布而非平均~Compare distributions|相同平均壽命可伴隨不同早期失效尾部。~Equal mean life can hide different early-failure tails.|比較中位數、散布與低分位區間。~Compare median, spread and lower-quantile intervals.
確認失效機制~Confirm failure mechanism|裂紋位置、金屬間化合物與基板裂損需要分開分類。~Crack location, intermetallic damage and substrate fracture need separate classes.|為每一失效附截面或等效證據。~Attach section or equivalent evidence to each failure class.
檢查加速有效性~Check acceleration validity|過度嚴苛條件可能引入服役中不會發生的新機制。~Overstress may introduce mechanisms absent in service.|比較加速與服役預期的斷口位置。~Compare accelerated fracture locations with service expectations.
完成可靠度結論~Complete reliability conclusion|結論應附樣本數、設限、條件及信賴範圍。~Conclusions need sample count, censoring, conditions and confidence bounds.|寫出資料能支持與不能支持的壽命主張。~State which life claims the data support and do not support.
''')

course(147,'水汽與材料~Moisture and materials|預處理與回焊~Preconditioning and reflow|失效識別~Failure identification|保管與證據~Storage and evidence','水分擴散、界面剝離與回焊蒸汽壓~Moisture diffusion, delamination and reflow vapor pressure','本課不是 MSL 標準替代品；實際等級、烘烤與回焊條件須依封裝規格及現行標準。~This course does not replace MSL standards; actual classification, bake and reflow conditions require package specifications and current standards.','假設一維特徵擴散長度 L=0.5 mm、D=10⁻¹² m²/s，t≈L²/D=2.5×10⁵ s≈69.4 h；厚度加倍使時間尺度約四倍，但這不是標準吸濕飽和時間。~For L=0.5 mm and D=10⁻¹² m²/s, t≈L²/D=2.5×10⁵ s≈69.4 h. Doubling thickness gives fourfold timescale; this is not a standardized saturation time.','吸水重量相同代表局部水分分布相同~Equal absorbed mass means identical local moisture distribution|烘乾後所有剝離都會自動癒合~Drying automatically heals all delamination',['nasa-pem','nasa-moisture'],[('a146','水分前處理影響熱循環結果~Moisture preconditioning affects thermal cycling','濕熱與乾熱需分開判定主因~Damp and dry heat need separate causal analysis'),('a149','聲學可比較回焊前後界面~Acoustics compare interfaces before and after reflow','聲學對比不能直接當作含水量~Acoustic contrast is not direct moisture content')],r'''
辨識吸濕材料~Identify moisture-absorbing materials|聚合物的平衡含水量與擴散速率是不同參數。~Equilibrium moisture uptake and diffusion rate are distinct polymer properties.|將容量與速度分列材料表。~Tabulate capacity and rate separately.
建立水分路徑~Map moisture paths|體擴散、界面與裂縫可形成不同的進水通道。~Bulk diffusion, interfaces and cracks form different ingress routes.|畫由外表面到敏感界面的路徑。~Draw paths from exterior to vulnerable interfaces.
定義環境歷史~Define environmental history|濕度、溫度及暴露時間共同決定水分狀態。~Humidity, temperature and exposure time jointly determine moisture state.|記錄開封、存放與測試時間。~Record opening, storage and test times.
檢查吸濕重量~Check uptake mass|秤重差須扣除漂移與表面污染，微小重量變化不能無限精確。~Mass change requires drift and contamination correction; tiny changes have finite precision.|以空白樣品估算秤重不確定度。~Use blanks to estimate weighing uncertainty.
估計擴散時間~Estimate diffusion time|L²/D 是尺度估算，邊界條件與濃度相依 D 會改變曲線。~L²/D estimates timescale; boundaries and concentration-dependent D alter the curve.|重算 69.4 h 並辨識幾何假設。~Recalculate 69.4 h and identify geometry assumptions.
理解回焊負荷~Understand reflow loading|快速升溫使含水界面承受蒸汽與熱失配共同負荷。~Rapid heating combines vapor and thermal-mismatch loading at moist interfaces.|畫水汽壓力與界面韌性的競爭。~Sketch competition between vapor pressure and interface toughness.
區分爆米花與腐蝕~Separate popcorning and corrosion|機械開裂與電化學腐蝕具有不同條件與時間尺度。~Mechanical cracking and electrochemical corrosion need different conditions and timescales.|列出能辨別兩者的影像及電性證據。~List imaging and electrical evidence distinguishing them.
判讀界面剝離~Interpret delamination|剝離可能先於電性失效；短期功能正常不能排除結構劣化。~Delamination can precede electrical failure; initial functionality does not exclude damage.|配準前後聲學影像與電性。~Register before/after acoustic maps with electrical data.
控制試驗混淆~Control test confounding|不同回焊歷史或材料批次會混淆水分效應。~Different reflow histories or lots confound moisture effects.|設乾燥與吸濕配對組。~Create paired dry and moisture-conditioned groups.
評估乾燥與再吸濕~Assess drying and reabsorption|乾燥移除水分但不必然逆轉已形成裂紋或腐蝕。~Drying removes moisture but need not reverse cracks or corrosion.|比較乾燥前後的結構及水分指標。~Compare structure and moisture indicators before and after drying.
管理暴露紀錄~Manage exposure records|防潮包裝與乾燥劑只有在完整保管流程中才有意義。~Moisture barriers and desiccants work within an intact handling process.|追蹤每次開封及剩餘暴露預算。~Track each opening and remaining exposure budget.
交付適用範圍~Deliver scope of qualification|一種封裝結果不能直接代表不同厚度或模封材料。~One package result does not qualify another thickness or molding compound.|列出任何變更需要重新評估的材料與幾何。~List material and geometry changes requiring reassessment.
''')

course(148,'負荷與材料~Loads and materials|非彈性應變~Inelastic strain|模型與資料~Models and data|壽命推論~Life inference','焊點蠕變、疲勞能量及模型外推~Solder creep, fatigue energy and model extrapolation','Coffin–Manson 與能量法係數需要材料和試驗校準；本課算例只展示比例敏感度，不產生可保證的服役壽命。~Coffin–Manson and energy-model coefficients require material/test calibration; examples show sensitivity, not guaranteed service life.','假設 N=C(Δεp)^(-2)，某樣品 Δεp=0.01 時 N=4000；若 Δεp=0.02，比例模型預測 N=1000。指數若為 1.5，則為 1414；模型形式的不確定度顯著。~Assume N=C(Δεp)^(-2) and N=4000 at Δεp=0.01. At 0.02 the model gives N=1000; exponent 1.5 instead gives 1414, illustrating model-form uncertainty.','所有焊料都可共用同一疲勞常數~All solders share the same fatigue constants|線彈性最大應力可完整預測焊料循環壽命~Peak linear-elastic stress completely predicts solder life',['nasa-fatigue','nasa-cycling'],[('a146','可靠度試驗提供設限及失效資料~Reliability tests provide censored and failed samples','模型還需局部應變與機制校準~Models additionally need local strain and mechanism calibration'),('a143','兩者都需界面失效與體材料破壞區分~Both separate interface and bulk failure','銀燒結不能沿用焊料蠕變常數~Silver sinter cannot reuse solder creep constants')],r'''
建立溫度載荷~Build thermal loading|峰值、停留與升降速率決定焊點黏塑性歷史。~Peaks, dwell and ramp determine viscoplastic history.|輸入完整循環而不是單一 ΔT。~Specify the full cycle rather than only ΔT.
辨識中性點距離~Identify distance to neutral point|外圍焊點常承受較大失配位移，但基板彎曲會改變排序。~Outer joints often see greater mismatch, but substrate bending can change ranking.|比較中央及角落焊點邊界。~Compare center and corner joint boundaries.
區分應力與應變~Separate stress and strain|焊料高溫鬆弛可降低應力而累積非彈性應變。~Hot solder can relax stress while accumulating inelastic strain.|畫一個具遲滯的應力應變迴圈。~Draw a hysteretic stress-strain loop.
選擇材料模型~Select constitutive model|溫度及應變速率相依參數需要對應焊料組織。~Temperature- and rate-dependent parameters must match solder microstructure.|記錄材料來源與校準範圍。~Record material source and calibration range.
檢查網格奇異性~Check mesh singularity|尖角最大應力隨網格改變，不能任意當壽命輸入。~Corner peak stress can change with mesh and is not an arbitrary life input.|比較體積平均量與單點峰值。~Compare volume-averaged quantities with point peaks.
追蹤穩定循環~Track stabilized cycles|第一循環與穩定遲滯迴圈不同，不能不說明就混用。~First-cycle and stabilized hysteresis differ and must not be mixed silently.|追蹤每循環非彈性能量是否收斂。~Track convergence of inelastic energy per cycle.
套用應變壽命比例~Apply strain-life scaling|冪律指數控制對應變幅度的敏感度，需要實驗支持。~The power-law exponent controls strain sensitivity and needs experimental support.|重算 4000 至 1000 的比例例。~Recalculate the 4000-to-1000 scaling example.
比較能量法~Compare energy methods|遲滯面積代表耗散，但能量密度到裂紋壽命還需校準。~Hysteresis area indicates dissipation, but life mapping still needs calibration.|同時報取樣體積及每循環能量。~Report averaging volume and per-cycle energy.
處理損傷累積~Handle accumulated damage|Miner 線性累積忽略載荷順序效應，並非所有焊點適用。~Linear Miner accumulation ignores sequence effects and is not universally valid.|比較高低負荷順序交換的假說。~Compare hypotheses for reversing high/low load order.
納入散布與設限~Include scatter and censoring|未失效樣品提供生存資訊，不能刪除或當終點失效。~Survivors contain information and cannot be discarded or counted as endpoint failures.|建立含設限欄位的校準表。~Create calibration data with censoring fields.
評估模型外推~Assess extrapolation|跨材料、幾何或溫度區域外推可能改變主導機制。~Extrapolation across material, geometry or temperature can change the mechanism.|列出試驗之外尚未驗證的工作點。~List operating points outside validated tests.
交付壽命區間~Deliver life intervals|工程決策需模型形式、參數與量測誤差的合併範圍。~Decisions need bounds combining model form, parameters and measurement error.|比較指數 2 與 1.5 的預測並說明差異。~Compare exponents 2 and 1.5 and explain the difference.
''')

course(149,'聲波與界面~Sound and interfaces|聚焦與閘門~Focus and gates|缺陷與判讀~Defects and interpretation|驗證與報告~Validation and reporting','聲阻抗、飛行時間與 C-SAM 界面圖~Acoustic impedance, time of flight and C-SAM interface maps','影像亮度取決於閘門、頻率與相位；暗區或亮區不具有普遍固定的缺陷含義，水耦合亦需評估樣品相容性。~Brightness depends on gate, frequency and phase; bright/dark regions have no universal defect meaning, and water coupling requires sample compatibility.','假設材料聲速 5000 m/s、雙程回波延遲 0.4 μs，深度 d=ct/2=1 mm；聲速 ±2% 單獨造成深度 ±20 μm。~With sound speed 5000 m/s and round-trip delay 0.4 μs, depth d=ct/2=1 mm. Sound-speed uncertainty ±2% alone gives depth uncertainty ±20 μm.','C-scan 像素大小就是實際空間解析度~C-scan pixel spacing equals true spatial resolution|所有亮點都代表空洞~Every bright spot is a void',['nordson','zeiss-package'],[('a150','同座標配準可比較內部缺陷~Registration compares buried defects at identical coordinates','聲學強於界面失配，X-ray 對密度幾何有不同對比~Acoustics emphasizes interface mismatch; X-ray uses different density/geometric contrast'),('a147','可追蹤吸濕回焊造成剝離~Tracks moisture/reflow delamination','聲學不直接量測水分含量~Acoustics does not directly measure moisture content')],r'''
辨識聲阻抗界面~Identify impedance interfaces|反射由密度乘聲速的差異決定，不只由材料硬度。~Reflection depends on density-times-sound-speed mismatch, not just hardness.|標示封裝各層聲阻抗差異。~Mark impedance changes through package layers.
區分 A B C 掃描~Distinguish A B C scans|A-scan 是時間波形，B-scan 是截面，C-scan 是閘門平面圖。~A-scan is a time trace, B-scan a section, C-scan a gated plan view.|把三者對應到同一界面。~Map all three to the same interface.
定位飛行時間~Locate time of flight|脈衝回波時間包含往返路徑，深度需除以二。~Pulse-echo time includes both directions; depth requires division by two.|驗算 0.4 μs 對應 1 mm。~Check that 0.4 μs corresponds to 1 mm.
設定焦點~Set focus|焦點外會降低橫向解析度及訊噪比，深層影像不應沿用表面焦點。~Defocus reduces lateral resolution and SNR; deep imaging needs its own focus.|掃焦並比較同一缺陷的邊界。~Sweep focus and compare the same defect boundary.
選擇頻率~Choose frequency|高頻提高潛在解析度但常增加衰減，深度與解析度需權衡。~Higher frequency improves potential resolution but often raises attenuation.|比較不同頻率的深層可見度。~Compare deep-feature visibility at different frequencies.
配置時間閘門~Configure time gates|閘門跨越多個回波會把不同界面混到同一圖。~A gate spanning multiple echoes mixes interfaces in one map.|從 A-scan 指定閘門起訖。~Set gate start and end from A-scans.
辨識相位反轉~Identify phase inversion|氣隙與實體界面可產生不同回波相位，幅值圖不保留全部資訊。~Air gaps and solid interfaces can differ in echo phase; amplitude maps lose information.|對照原始波形與顏色圖。~Compare raw waveforms against color maps.
排除聲影~Exclude acoustic shadows|上層強反射或吸收會遮蔽下層，黑暗區未必代表下層完整。~Strong upper reflection or absorption shadows deeper layers; darkness does not prove integrity.|改從另一面或用其他方法驗證。~Check from the opposite face or with another method.
量化缺陷面積~Quantify defect area|分割閾值和點擴散函數會改變面積估計。~Segmentation thresholds and point-spread functions affect area estimates.|改兩個閾值報告面積範圍。~Use two thresholds and report an area interval.
交叉截面驗證~Cross-check with sections|破壞截面只看局部，但能驗證聲學所指界面。~A destructive section is local but can verify the indicated interface.|配準座標後挑代表區切片。~Register coordinates and select a representative section.
控制量測重複性~Control repeatability|水溫、耦合、裝夾與增益會改變前後比較。~Water temperature, coupling, mounting and gain affect comparisons.|固定設定並用標準件追蹤漂移。~Fix settings and track drift with a reference.
完成缺陷報告~Complete defect report|需附頻率、閘門、焦點、像素與確認方法，不能只交彩圖。~Report frequency, gate, focus, pixels and confirmation method, not just a color map.|為未能看清的深層標記未確定。~Mark obscured deeper layers as unresolved.
''')

course(150,'投影與吸收~Projection and absorption|掃描與重建~Scanning and reconstruction|缺陷量化~Defect quantification|相關驗證~Correlative validation','X-ray CT 投影、體素與重建偽影~X-ray CT projections, voxels and reconstruction artifacts','體素尺寸不等於解析度；CT 未見缺陷不表示界面無裂縫，尤其薄而低對比缺陷須用其他方法交叉驗證。~Voxel size is not resolution; absent CT contrast does not prove a crack-free interface, especially for thin low-contrast defects.','假設一球形空洞直徑 20 μm，體積 πd³/6≈4189 μm³；直徑誤差 ±2 μm 對體積約造成 ±30% 一階相對不確定度。~For a hypothetical spherical 20 μm void, volume πd³/6≈4189 μm³. Diameter uncertainty ±2 μm gives approximately ±30% first-order relative volume uncertainty.','更小體素必定有同等更高解析度~Smaller voxels always give proportionally higher resolution|重建亮環一定是材料實體~A reconstructed bright ring must be real material',['zeiss-package','zeiss-ct'],[('a149','相同缺陷可用不同物理對比互證~Different physical contrast can corroborate a defect','CT 以衰減重建體積，SAM 著重界面回波~CT reconstructs attenuation volumes; SAM emphasizes interface echoes'),('a122','CT 可尋找 TSV 填充空洞~CT can locate TSV filling voids','金屬密度與遮蔽限制微小空洞可見度~Metal density and shadowing limit tiny-void visibility')],r'''
定義檢測目標~Define inspection target|空洞、橋接與裂紋的尺度和方向不同，需先說明要檢出的缺陷。~Voids, bridges and cracks differ in scale and orientation; define the target first.|為每類缺陷列最小關注尺度。~List minimum relevant size for each class.
理解衰減投影~Understand attenuation projections|投影整合整條射線的衰減，單張平面圖會重疊深度資訊。~A projection integrates attenuation along a ray and overlaps depth information.|用兩個重疊空洞示範投影歧義。~Demonstrate ambiguity with two overlapping voids.
分開幾何放大與解析度~Separate magnification and resolution|焦點尺寸、探測器與樣品運動共同限制解析度。~Source size, detector and motion jointly limit resolution.|列出體素之外至少兩個模糊來源。~List two blur sources beyond voxel spacing.
設計角度採樣~Design angular sampling|投影不足或有限角度可產生方向性偽影。~Insufficient or limited-angle views create directional artifacts.|比較完整旋轉與受限旋轉假想結果。~Compare full-rotation and limited-rotation results.
控制金屬偽影~Control metal artifacts|高吸收金屬會造成束硬化與條紋，可能遮蔽鄰近缺陷。~Dense metal causes beam hardening and streaks that may hide nearby defects.|檢查偽影是否隨角度或修正而改變。~Check whether artifacts change with angle or correction.
確認機械穩定~Confirm mechanical stability|掃描中的漂移會讓邊界模糊，即使重建體素很小。~Motion during scanning blurs boundaries despite small reconstructed voxels.|用固定結構追蹤投影位移。~Track projection shifts using a fixed feature.
選擇重建與校正~Select reconstruction and correction|濾波、環狀修正與去噪可能改變細節，不可當成中性處理。~Filtering, ring correction and denoising can alter detail.|保留原始與處理後切片供對照。~Retain raw and processed slices for comparison.
分割三維缺陷~Segment 3D defects|局部閾值與部分體積效應影響空洞邊界。~Local thresholds and partial-volume effects alter void boundaries.|以兩種分割設定估計體積範圍。~Estimate a volume interval using two segmentation settings.
驗算空洞體積~Calculate void volume|體積對直徑呈三次方敏感，小尺寸誤差可明顯放大。~Volume scales with diameter cubed, amplifying small size errors.|重算 20 μm 球形例並用 18 和 22 μm 比較。~Recalculate the 20 μm sphere at 18 and 22 μm.
檢查連通性~Check connectivity|孔隙率相同而是否貫穿或接近熱點不同，功能影響也不同。~Equal porosity can differ in connectivity and hotspot proximity.|標記孤立孔洞及貫穿路徑。~Mark isolated voids and through-paths.
配準其他量測~Register other measurements|聲學、電性與截面各有盲點，座標一致才能互證。~Acoustics, electrical tests and sections have different blind spots; registration enables comparison.|把一個 CT 缺陷對應到電阻異常區。~Map one CT defect to an electrical anomaly.
撰寫檢出界限~Report detection limits|報告應含解析度證據、視野與未觀察到的方向。~Reports need resolution evidence, field of view and unobserved orientations.|明確區分未檢出與證明不存在。~Distinguish not detected from proven absent.
''')

course(151,'模態與截面~Modes and cross-sections|圖形與蝕刻~Patterning and etch|損耗量測~Loss metrology|設計與製程窗~Design and process bounds','SOI 波導侷限、側壁散射與 cutback~SOI confinement, sidewall scattering and cutback','波導尺寸須依實際 PDK；本課不把單一公開截面當成所有代工廠共通設計規則。~Waveguide dimensions must follow the actual PDK; one public cross-section is not a universal foundry rule.','假設兩條相同耦合器波導長差 2 cm、插入損耗差 1.2 dB，cutback 斜率 0.6 dB/cm；若差值不確定度 0.1 dB，斜率不確定度為 0.05 dB/cm。~For identical couplers, length difference 2 cm and insertion-loss difference 1.2 dB, cutback gives 0.6 dB/cm. A 0.1 dB difference uncertainty gives 0.05 dB/cm slope uncertainty.','有效折射率與群折射率相同~Effective index equals group index|單條波導插入損耗就是傳播損耗~One waveguide insertion loss equals propagation loss',['imec-platform','ansys-mode'],[('a152','模態與 cutback 方法可轉到 SiN~Modes and cutback transfer to SiN','SiN 折射率對比與吸收機制不同~SiN has different index contrast and absorption'),('a155','波導模場是邊緣耦合器輸入~Waveguide fields are inputs to edge couplers','耦合器需展模與封裝間隙容差~Couplers need mode expansion and package-gap tolerances')],r'''
畫出 SOI 截面~Draw SOI cross-section|矽核心、埋氧與上包覆共同決定模態，不只核心寬度。~Silicon core, buried oxide and top cladding jointly determine modes.|標記 strip 與 rib 的不同邊界。~Mark differing strip and rib boundaries.
求解導引模態~Solve guided modes|有效折射率由邊界值問題決定，材料 n 不能直接替代模態 neff。~Effective index comes from a boundary-value problem, not material n alone.|比較核心與包覆能量占比。~Compare core and cladding energy fractions.
區分相位與群速度~Separate phase and group velocity|ng=neff−λ dneff/dλ，頻散會使群延遲不同於相位延遲。~ng=neff−λ dneff/dλ; dispersion separates group and phase delay.|從三個波長的 neff 估算導數。~Estimate the derivative from neff at three wavelengths.
追蹤圖形偏差~Track pattern bias|線寬與側壁角偏差同時改變侷限、相位及耦合。~Width and sidewall-angle errors change confinement, phase and coupling.|用寬度高低角點比較 neff。~Compare neff at high/low width corners.
辨識側壁粗糙~Identify sidewall roughness|粗糙幅度與相關長度一起影響散射，不能只報一個 RMS。~Roughness amplitude and correlation length jointly affect scattering.|保存側壁取樣長度與頻譜資訊。~Record sampling length and spectral information.
分析蝕刻殘層~Analyze residual slabs|rib 殘層可改變模態與彎曲洩漏，不是可忽略底層。~A rib slab alters modes and bend leakage and cannot be ignored.|比較全蝕刻及部分蝕刻截面。~Compare fully and partially etched sections.
建立 cutback 結構~Build cutback structures|不同長度需共用可比耦合與彎曲條件。~Different lengths require comparable couplers and bends.|列出長度改變時保持固定的項目。~List terms held fixed when changing length.
辨識彎曲損耗~Identify bend loss|彎曲半徑影響輻射與模態轉換，不能混進直線損耗斜率。~Bend radius affects radiation and mode conversion and can bias straight-loss slope.|對照相同長度不同彎數。~Compare equal lengths with different bend counts.
驗算傳播損耗~Calculate propagation loss|dB 損耗對長度線性只是均勻傳播模型，耦合偏差會改變截距。~Linear dB loss versus length assumes uniform propagation; coupling affects intercept.|重算 0.6 dB/cm 並估斜率誤差。~Recalculate 0.6 dB/cm and slope uncertainty.
檢查偏振差異~Check polarization dependence|TE 與 TM 對側壁及厚度誤差的靈敏度不同。~TE and TM respond differently to width and thickness errors.|保留兩偏振光譜而非只報最佳值。~Keep both polarization spectra, not only the best value.
建立製程角點~Build process corners|全片共同偏差與局部隨機變異具有不同相關性。~Wafer-wide bias and local random variation have different correlations.|分開全局寬度偏移與局部散布。~Separate global width bias from local spread.
交付波導模型~Deliver waveguide model|模型需包含波長、溫度、損耗及製程適用範圍。~Models need wavelength, temperature, loss and process validity ranges.|用未參與擬合的波導驗證預測。~Validate against a waveguide excluded from fitting.
''')

course(152,'材料與頻譜~Materials and spectra|應力與模態~Stress and modes|損耗與共振~Loss and resonance|整合與驗證~Integration and validation','SiN 低損耗、薄膜應力與吸收頻譜~SiN low loss, film stress and absorption spectra','不同沉積與退火路徑不可互換；低損耗紀錄屬特定波長與製程，不是所有 SiN 元件的保證。~Deposition and annealing routes are not interchangeable; record losses apply to specified wavelength/process, not every SiN device.','假設 ng=2、λ=1550 nm、內部 Q=10⁶，α=2πng/(Qλ)=8.11 m⁻¹，等於約 0.352 dB/cm；此式假設已分離耦合損耗。~For ng=2, λ=1550 nm and intrinsic Q=10⁶, α=2πng/(Qλ)=8.11 m⁻¹≈0.352 dB/cm. Coupling loss must already be separated.','負載 Q 可不經校正直接當內部 Q~Loaded Q directly equals intrinsic Q|SiN 沒有任何材料吸收~SiN has no material absorption',['imec-platform','ansys-mode','swg-paper'],[('a151','模態、cutback 與角點方法可共用~Modes, cutback and corners are shared methods','SiN 常有不同熱預算、應力與非線性~SiN differs in thermal budget, stress and nonlinearity'),('a183','低傳播損耗支持高 Q 頻率梳~Low loss supports high-Q comb resonators','頻率梳還需色散與非線性相位匹配~Combs additionally require dispersion and nonlinear matching')],r'''
選定工作頻帶~Choose operating band|低損耗需連到特定波長，鍵結吸收與包覆會形成頻譜限制。~Low loss is wavelength-specific; bond absorption and cladding limit spectra.|標記預定波段及可能吸收區。~Mark operating and possible absorption bands.
比較薄膜路徑~Compare film routes|不同沉積溫度改變氫含量、應力與後段相容性。~Deposition temperature changes hydrogen, stress and backend compatibility.|列表比較公開材料特性而非複製配方。~Compare published material properties without copying recipes.
建立應力預算~Budget film stress|厚膜殘餘拉應力可能引發裂紋，光學厚度與機械可靠度需協調。~Tensile stress in thick films can cause cracks; optical thickness and mechanics must align.|在截面標出受約束膜層。~Mark constrained layers in a section.
控制波導截面~Control waveguide section|較低折射率對比通常需要不同彎曲與模場設計。~Lower index contrast generally requires different bends and mode sizes.|用相同彎曲半徑比較 Si 與 SiN 概念模態。~Compare conceptual Si and SiN modes at the same bend radius.
管理側壁與上表面~Manage sidewalls and top surface|光場與粗糙界面重疊決定散射敏感度。~Field overlap with rough interfaces controls scattering sensitivity.|將模場強度疊到粗糙界面位置。~Overlay field intensity on rough interfaces.
處理包覆與裂紋~Handle cladding and cracks|包覆改變光學邊界，也可改變應力和熱路。~Cladding changes optical boundaries, stress and heat paths.|比較包覆前後的模態與曲率。~Compare modes and curvature before and after cladding.
配置低損耗量測~Plan low-loss measurement|損耗很低時，短測試線差值接近量測漂移。~At very low loss, short-length differences approach measurement drift.|增加有效長差並保留漂移參考。~Increase effective length difference and retain a drift reference.
分開內部與耦合 Q~Separate intrinsic and coupling Q|1/QL=1/Qi+1/Qc；負載線寬不能單獨給出材料損耗。~1/QL=1/Qi+1/Qc; loaded linewidth alone does not give material loss.|用共振深度與線形協助辨識耦合。~Use resonance depth and shape to assess coupling.
驗算 Q 與損耗~Calculate Q-to-loss relation|Q-to-loss 換算需要群折射率與一致的功率衰減定義。~Q-to-loss conversion requires group index and a consistent power-decay convention.|重算 0.352 dB/cm 並檢查 m 與 cm。~Recalculate 0.352 dB/cm and check m/cm conversion.
追蹤熱頻移~Track thermal resonance shift|溫度漂移會使狹窄共振掃描失真或看似變寬。~Thermal drift can distort or broaden narrow resonance scans.|比較上下掃頻與不同光功率。~Compare up/down sweeps and optical powers.
評估色散~Assess dispersion|群速度色散由頻率曲率決定，不可用單一 neff 推斷。~Group-velocity dispersion depends on frequency curvature, not one neff value.|用多點模態資料檢查導數收斂。~Check derivative convergence with multipoint modal data.
交付低損耗主張~Deliver a low-loss claim|需同時說明波段、偏振、方法與不確定度。~State band, polarization, method and uncertainty together.|區分單顆最佳值與跨晶片分布。~Separate best-device results from cross-die distributions.
''')

course(153,'週期與有效介質~Period and effective medium|單胞與模態~Unit cells and modes|轉接與容差~Transitions and tolerance|驗證與應用~Validation and application','SWG Bloch 模態、填充比與頻散~SWG Bloch modes, fill factor and dispersion','有效介質只在適當次波長及緩變條件近似成立；接近 Bragg 區或尖銳不連續處需全波/Bloch 分析。~Effective medium is approximate in a suitable subwavelength, slowly varying regime; near Bragg conditions or discontinuities use full-wave/Bloch analysis.','假設 λ=1550 nm、neff=2.5，簡化一阶 Bragg 週期為 λ/(2neff)=310 nm。選 250 nm 僅表示低於此估值，仍須求解 Bloch 色散及確認整個工作頻帶。~For λ=1550 nm and neff=2.5, a simplified first-order Bragg period is 310 nm. A 250 nm period is below this estimate but still needs Bloch dispersion across the operating band.','只要週期小於自由空間波長就沒有 Bragg 效應~Any period below free-space wavelength avoids Bragg effects|填充比平均折射率永遠精確~Fill-factor-averaged index is always exact',['swg-paper','ansys-mode'],[('a154','週期圖案可控制折射率與散射~Periodic patterns control index and scattering','SWG 通常抑制繞射，光柵耦合器刻意向外輻射~SWG often suppresses diffraction; grating couplers deliberately radiate'),('a152','SiN 平台可實現 SWG 模態工程~SiN can implement SWG mode engineering','分段結構新增最小特徵及轉接損耗~Segmentation adds minimum-feature and transition-loss constraints')],r'''
定義週期方向~Define periodic direction|週期必須相對傳播方向與偏振定義。~Period must be defined relative to propagation and polarization.|畫單胞、週期與光傳播向量。~Draw unit cell, period and propagation vector.
檢查次波長條件~Check subwavelength regime|導波波長不同於自由空間波長，Bragg 判斷要用模態。~Guided wavelength differs from free-space wavelength; Bragg checks need the mode.|驗算 310 nm 的簡化界限。~Recalculate the simplified 310 nm boundary.
辨識有效介質近似~Identify effective-medium approximation|分段介質可表現各向異性，純標量平均常不足。~Segmented media can be anisotropic; scalar averaging is often insufficient.|比較平行與垂直偏振的近似。~Compare approximations for orthogonal polarizations.
設定填充比~Set fill factor|填充比改變有效折射率，也改變最窄線段及間隙。~Fill factor changes effective index and minimum segments/gaps.|同時列光學目標與製造最小特徵。~List optical targets and minimum manufacturable features.
求解 Bloch 模態~Solve Bloch modes|相鄰單胞的相位關係决定能帶與群速度。~Intercell phase relations determine bands and group velocity.|掃 Bloch 相位並標出通帶。~Sweep Bloch phase and mark passbands.
檢查漏模與反射~Check leakage and reflection|有限長度及包覆邊界可引入無限週期模型沒有的散射。~Finite length and cladding introduce scattering absent in infinite periodic models.|比較單胞與有限結構響應。~Compare unit-cell and finite-structure responses.
設計漸變轉接~Design gradual transitions|傳統波導到 SWG 的模態不匹配會造成額外損耗。~Mode mismatch between conventional and SWG guides adds loss.|比較突變與漸變填充比轉接。~Compare abrupt and tapered fill-factor transitions.
建立製程角點~Build process corners|蝕刻偏差可同時改變線段與間隙，兩者不是獨立亂數。~Etch bias changes segments and gaps together; they are correlated.|用共同偏差更新整個單胞。~Apply a shared bias to the entire unit cell.
分析覆蓋物敏感度~Analyze cladding sensitivity|包覆重疊增加可提升感測，亦增加污染與溫漂敏感。~Greater cladding overlap can improve sensing but raises contamination and drift sensitivity.|比較包覆折射率改變的模態位移。~Compare modal shifts under cladding-index changes.
驗證頻帶邊界~Validate band boundaries|中心波長低損耗不代表整個頻帶都遠離帶邊。~Low loss at center wavelength does not guarantee distance from band edges everywhere.|掃最短至最長工作波長。~Sweep the full operating wavelength range.
分離散射與吸收~Separate scattering and absorption|傳輸下降可能是反射、輻射或吸收，總功率需分流核對。~Reduced transmission can be reflection, radiation or absorption.|記錄 T、R 及剩餘能量項。~Record T, R and remaining energy terms.
交付 SWG 模型~Deliver SWG model|需附單胞、有限長度、頻帶、偏振與容差。~Deliver unit cell, finite length, band, polarization and tolerances.|指出有效介質與全波結果差異最大的點。~Identify the largest effective-medium/full-wave discrepancy.
''')

course(154,'相位與光纖~Phase and fiber|輻射與模場~Radiation and fields|容差與量測~Tolerance and measurement|封裝交接~Package handoff','光柵相位匹配、方向性與模場重疊~Grating phase matching, directionality and modal overlap','簡化光柵方程只給初始週期；最佳效率需考慮向下輻射、反射、有限孔徑、偏振與實際纖芯模場。~The simple grating equation only seeds period; efficiency also depends on downward radiation, reflection, aperture, polarization and fiber fields.','假設 λ=1550 nm、neff=2.6、上方 n=1、出射角 10°，一階 Λ≈λ/(neff−n sinθ)=639 nm；未包含擾動後 Bloch 指數修正。~For λ=1550 nm, neff=2.6, upper n=1 and 10° emission, first-order Λ≈λ/(neff−n sinθ)=639 nm, excluding perturbed Bloch-index correction.','光柵向上輻射效率就是光纖耦合效率~Upward radiation efficiency equals fiber coupling efficiency|中心波長對準即可保證寬頻最佳~Center alignment guarantees broadband optimum',['ansys-grating','imec-platform'],[('a153','週期單胞與製造偏差分析共用~Periodic-cell and bias analysis are shared','光柵耦合器需要可控制的輻射通道~Grating couplers require controlled radiation'),('a156','效率地圖轉成光纖主動對準目標~Efficiency maps become active-alignment objectives','元件模態最佳化與機台搜尋誤差需分離~Device optimization differs from stage search error')],r'''
設定光纖與偏振~Specify fiber and polarization|耦合目標是特定纖模，不能以任意高斯光斑代替所有纖種。~The target is a specific fiber mode, not any Gaussian beam.|記錄模場直徑及偏振定義。~Record mode-field diameter and polarization.
選擇出射角~Select emission angle|傾角影響相位匹配、回反射及封裝空間。~Angle affects phase matching, reflection and packaging space.|畫光柵法線與入射角約定。~Draw the normal and incidence-angle convention.
估計初始週期~Estimate seed period|光柵動量將導波模式連到輻射模式，正負階次需一致。~Grating momentum links guided and radiative modes with consistent order signs.|重算 639 nm 並核對角度單位。~Recalculate 639 nm with consistent angle units.
設計刻槽與填充~Design grooves and fill|蝕刻深度及填充比同時控制散射強度與有效指數。~Etch depth and fill factor affect scattering and effective index together.|做二參數敏感度圖而非單參數最佳化。~Build a two-parameter sensitivity map.
分離方向性~Separate directionality|向上與向下功率比例只是效率鏈的一環。~Upward/downward power ratio is only one part of the efficiency chain.|列出入射、反射、上下輻射及吸收。~List incident, reflected, upward, downward and absorbed power.
計算模場重疊~Calculate modal overlap|重疊需複數電場相位與幅度，強度圖相似不保證高耦合。~Overlap needs complex amplitude and phase; similar intensities do not guarantee coupling.|比較同強度但反相的兩模場。~Compare equal-intensity fields with opposite phase.
使用漸變光柵~Use apodization|漸變散射可塑形出射場，但新增製造容差與最小特徵限制。~Apodized scattering shapes output fields but adds tolerance and feature constraints.|將目標包絡連到每段散射變化。~Relate target envelope to segment scattering.
掃描位置與角度~Sweep position and angle|最佳 z、橫向位置與傾角可能耦合，逐軸搜尋可能錯失聯合最佳點。~Height, lateral position and angle can couple; independent scans may miss the joint optimum.|畫位置角度二維效率圖。~Plot a position-angle efficiency map.
量測頻譜損耗~Measure spectral loss|兩光柵回路包含兩端耦合及中間傳播，不能將總損耗當單端值。~A two-grating loop includes both couplers and propagation.|扣除傳播後再估單端損耗。~Subtract propagation before estimating per-coupler loss.
分析製程散布~Analyze process variation|週期、刻深及包覆偏差會移動中心波長及頻寬。~Period, depth and cladding bias shift center wavelength and bandwidth.|比較同片不同位置的光譜。~Compare spectra across wafer locations.
檢查封裝材料~Check package materials|膠與蓋板改變上方折射率，裸晶最佳角度未必仍成立。~Adhesive and covers change upper index; bare-die optimum may shift.|加入封裝上層重算相位匹配。~Add package superstrate and recalculate matching.
交付耦合容差~Deliver coupling tolerances|需以整個頻帶和通道最差值定義放行，而非單一峰值。~Acceptance uses worst channel across the band, not one peak.|交付峰值、頻寬與位置容差。~Deliver peak efficiency, bandwidth and positional tolerance.
''')

course(155,'模態與展模~Modes and expansion|錐形與端面~Tapers and facets|耦合與容差~Coupling and tolerance|固定與驗證~Attachment and validation','邊緣耦合模場展開、端面反射與對準~Edge-coupler mode expansion, facet reflection and alignment','高斯重疊只是近似；實際向量模態、端面角度、空隙與偏振需用完整場解或量測驗證。~Gaussian overlap is approximate; vector modes, facet angle, gaps and polarization need field simulation or measurement.','相同高斯模場假設 η=exp[−(Δx/w)²]，w=2 μm、偏移 1 μm 時 η=0.779、損耗 1.09 dB；w 為 1/e² 強度半徑。~For identical Gaussian modes η=exp[−(Δx/w)²], w=2 μm and offset 1 μm give η=0.779 and 1.09 dB loss; w is the 1/e² intensity radius.','錐尖越窄就一定越低損耗~A narrower taper tip always gives lower loss|模場直徑可與半徑混用~Mode-field diameter and radius are interchangeable',['ansys-edge','imec-platform'],[('a154','都需模場重疊與位置容差~Both need modal overlap and positional tolerance','邊緣耦合由端面進光，光柵從上方輻射~Edge couplers enter a facet; gratings radiate vertically'),('a158','耦合容差直接約束膠收縮~Coupling tolerances directly constrain adhesive shrinkage','光學設計不能替代固化後穩定性驗證~Optical design does not replace post-cure stability tests')],r'''
比較晶片與光纖模場~Compare chip and fiber modes|模式尺寸差異會限制耦合，即使幾何中心完全重合。~Mode-size mismatch limits coupling despite aligned centers.|畫同功率正規化的兩模場。~Draw two equal-power normalized fields.
設計反向錐形~Design an inverse taper|核心縮小讓光場進入包覆，但過小特徵提高製造敏感度。~A narrower core expands fields into cladding but raises fabrication sensitivity.|比較展模效益與最小線寬。~Compare expansion benefit with minimum linewidth.
檢查絕熱條件~Check adiabaticity|沿程變化太快會耦合到高階或輻射模態。~Rapid longitudinal change couples into higher or radiative modes.|比較短錐與長錐的模式功率。~Compare modal powers for short and long tapers.
設定端面幾何~Set facet geometry|端面粗糙、角度和後退距離影響反射與散射。~Facet roughness, angle and setback affect reflection and scattering.|標出切割面與光學有效端點。~Mark cut face and optical endpoint.
配置包覆結構~Configure cladding|包覆折射率及厚度決定展開模態是否受束縛。~Cladding index and thickness determine expanded-mode confinement.|比較有無底部洩漏的截面。~Compare sections with and without substrate leakage.
計算端面反射~Calculate facet reflection|單界面 Fresnel 是起點，多界面空隙會形成干涉。~Single-interface Fresnel reflection is a starting point; gaps create multi-interface interference.|畫晶片空氣光纖三層反射路徑。~Draw chip-air-fiber reflection paths.
建立橫向容差~Build lateral tolerance|較大模場可增加偏移容忍，但也改變封裝尺寸需求。~Larger modes tolerate offset but alter package requirements.|重算 1 μm 偏移的 1.09 dB 例。~Recalculate 1.09 dB loss at 1 μm offset.
加入角度與軸向誤差~Add angular and axial error|橫向、角度與離焦損耗可能同時存在，不能逐項用最佳值。~Lateral, angular and defocus losses coexist; individual best cases cannot be combined.|選三項非零誤差組成角點。~Build a corner with three nonzero errors.
量測反射與傳輸~Measure reflection and transmission|低插損不代表低回反射，雷射穩定性可能另外受限。~Low insertion loss does not imply low return reflection; lasers may still destabilize.|分別列插損及回損量測。~List insertion- and return-loss measurements separately.
評估端面損傷~Assess facet damage|切割微裂與碎屑可造成散射，對準重試不能修復。~Dicing cracks and debris scatter light; realignment cannot repair them.|比較端面影像與對準掃描形狀。~Compare facet images with alignment-scan shapes.
驗證固化後位置~Validate post-cure position|膠固化與釋放夾持都可能改變最佳位置。~Cure and fixture release can shift the optimum.|量測固定前後完整損耗地圖。~Measure full loss maps before and after attachment.
交付耦合器規格~Deliver coupler specification|需明列偏振、模場定義、波段及裝配容差。~Specify polarization, mode-field convention, band and assembly tolerance.|把模場半徑與直徑寫成兩個不同欄位。~Record mode radius and diameter as separate fields.
''')

