('imec-platform','矽光子代工與平台能力','Silicon photonics foundry services','imec','https://www.imec-int.com/en/what-we-offer/development/photonics','公開平台元件及製程整合概念；不包含未公開 PDK 規則。','Public platform components and integration concepts, not unpublished PDK rules.'),
('ansys-mode','光波導與耦合器模態設計','Lumerical MODE waveguide and coupler design','Ansys','https://www.ansys.com/products/photonics/mode','模態、波導、耦合器及設計工作流程背景。','Background on modes, waveguides, couplers and design workflows.'),
